hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1260","Muhammad bin Abi Safwan Al-Thaqafi told us, Abdul Salam bin Hashim told us, Othman bin Saad Al-Kateb told us, and he had chivalry and a mind, On the authority of Anas bin Malik, he said: The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, “would not descend to a certain place without saying farewell to it with two rak’ahs.”"
